-- src:1009 | (2) A person falls within this section if—
-- src:1010 | (a) the person has limited capability for work and work-related activity,
-- src:1011 | (b) the person has regular and substantial caring responsibilities for a severely disabled person,
-- src:1012 | (c) the person is a single person responsible for a child under the age of 1,
-- src:1013 | (d) the person is of a prescribed description.
@ref s 57 WRA2007 11D(2) (src:1009-1013)
GIVEN `the person has limited capability for work and work-related activity` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the responsibilities are regular and substantial caring responsibilities as regulations prescribe` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person cared for is severely disabled as regulations prescribe` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 39(1) the person is a member of a couple` IS A BOOLEAN
      `regulations specify circumstances in which the person is or is not responsible for the child, and these are they` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the age of the child in years` IS A NUMBER
      `the person is of a description prescribed for section 11D(2)(d)` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 57 WRA2007 11D(2) the person falls within section 11D` MEANS
    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "A person falls within this section if (a) ... (b) ... (c) ... (d) ..." -- none of the four holds (a failed "if", reading (a) of NOTES)
    `s 46 JSA 19 Kleene either` `limb (a)` (`s 46 JSA 19 Kleene either` `limb (b)` (`s 46 JSA 19 Kleene either` `limb (c)` `limb (d)`))
    WHERE
        `limb (a)` MEANS JUST `the person has limited capability for work and work-related activity`
        `limb (b)` MEANS
            `s 46 JSA 19 Kleene both` (`s 57 WRA2007 11D(4) the responsibilities are regular and substantial caring responsibilities` `the responsibilities are regular and substantial caring responsibilities as regulations prescribe`) (`s 57 WRA2007 11D(4) the person cared for is severely disabled` `the person cared for is severely disabled as regulations prescribe`)
        `limb (c)` MEANS
            `s 46 JSA 19 Kleene both` (JUST (`s 57(4) WRA2007 24(1) the person is a single person` `s 39(1) the person is a member of a couple`)) (`s 46 JSA 19 Kleene both` (`s 57(8) WRA2007 Sch 2 para 10B the person is responsible for the child` `regulations specify circumstances in which the person is or is not responsible for the child, and these are they`) (JUST (`the age of the child in years` LESS THAN 1)))
        `limb (d)` MEANS `the person is of a description prescribed for section 11D(2)(d)`

