§ `s 57 WRA2007 11F: persons subject to work preparation and work-focused interview requirement`

-- src:1025 | (1) A person who does not fall within section 11D or 11E falls within this section.
@ref s 57 WRA2007 11F(1) (src:1025)
GIVEN `the person falls within section 11D` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person falls within section 11E` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 57 WRA2007 11F(1) the person falls within section 11F` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the person falls within section 11D` EQUALS JUST FALSE AND `the person falls within section 11E` EQUALS JUST FALSE
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "A person who does not fall within section 11D or 11E falls within this section" says nothing of a person who does (fork F-57-2, NOTES)
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

DECLARE `s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) requirement` IS ONE OF
    `s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) a work preparation requirement`
    `s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) a work-focused interview requirement`
    `s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) some other requirement`

-- src:1026 | (2) The Secretary of State may, subject to this Part, impose a work preparation requirement or work-focused interview requirement on a person entitled to an employment and support allowance who falls within this section.
@ref s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) (src:1026)
GIVEN `the requirement` IS A `s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) requirement`
      `the person is entitled to an employment and support allowance` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the person falls within section 11F` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `another provision of this Part limits the imposition` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) the Secretary of State may impose the requirement` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT `the person is entitled to an employment and support allowance`
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the grant is of "a person entitled to an employment and support allowance who falls within this section"
        THEN NOTHING
        IF NOT (`the person falls within section 11F` EQUALS JUST TRUE)
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the grant is for a person who falls within section 11F
        THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE CONSIDER `the requirement`
            WHEN `s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) a work preparation requirement` THEN `s 57 WRA2007 11E(2) and 11F(2) subject to this Part` `another provision of this Part limits the imposition`
            WHEN `s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) a work-focused interview requirement` THEN `s 57 WRA2007 11E(2) and 11F(2) subject to this Part` `another provision of this Part limits the imposition`
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "a work preparation requirement or work-focused interview requirement" are what this subsection lets the Secretary of State impose
            WHEN `s 57 WRA2007 11F(2) some other requirement` THEN NOTHING

-- src:969 | (3) The work-related requirements which may be imposed on a person depend on which of the following groups the person falls into—
-- src:970 | (a) persons subject to no work-related requirements (see section 11D);
-- src:971 | (b) persons subject to work-focused interview requirement only (see section 11E);
-- src:972 | (c) persons subject to work-focused interview and work preparation requirements (see section 11F).
@ref s 57 WRA2007 11(3) (src:969-972)
GIVEN `the person falls within section 11D` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the person falls within section 11E` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE `s 57 WRA2007 11(3) group`
`s 57 WRA2007 11(3) the group the person falls into` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the person falls within section 11D` EQUALS JUST TRUE AND `the person falls within section 11E` EQUALS JUST FALSE
        THEN JUST `s 57 WRA2007 11(3)(a) persons subject to no work-related requirements (see section 11D)`
        IF `the person falls within section 11D` EQUALS JUST FALSE AND `the person falls within section 11E` EQUALS JUST TRUE
        THEN JUST `s 57 WRA2007 11(3)(b) persons subject to work-focused interview requirement only (see section 11E)`
        IF `the person falls within section 11D` EQUALS JUST FALSE AND `the person falls within section 11E` EQUALS JUST FALSE
        THEN JUST `s 57 WRA2007 11(3)(c) persons subject to work-focused interview and work preparation requirements (see section 11F)`
        -- NOTHING-kind (silent): the Act does not say which group a person falls into who is within both 11D and 11E (fork F-57-1, NOTES); the answer is also unknown when either input is unknown
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

