    CONSIDER `the purpose`
    WHEN `s 57 WRA2007 11G(1)(a) the imposition of a work-related requirement on the person` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 57 WRA2007 11G(1)(b) verifying the person's compliance with a work-related requirement` THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN `s 57 WRA2007 11G(1)(c) assisting the person to comply with a work-related requirement` THEN JUST TRUE
    -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "any purpose relating to" the three listed; a purpose that does not relate to them is outside the grant
    OTHERWISE NOTHING

