        IF `the manner of notification is one the Secretary of State has determined`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "notified to the person in such manner as the Secretary of State may determine" says nothing of a manner the Secretary of State has not determined
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

