§ `s 57 WRA2007 11K: delegation and contracting out`

DECLARE `s 57 WRA2007 11K(2) kind of authorisation` IS ONE OF
    `s 57 WRA2007 11K(2)(a) an authorisation wholly`
    `s 57 WRA2007 11K(2)(a) an authorisation to a limited extent`
    `s 57 WRA2007 11K(2)(b) an authorisation generally`
    `s 57 WRA2007 11K(2)(b) an authorisation in particular cases or areas`
    `s 57 WRA2007 11K(2)(c) an authorisation unconditionally`
    `s 57 WRA2007 11K(2)(c) an authorisation subject to conditions`
    `s 57 WRA2007 11K(2) some other kind of authorisation`

-- src:1087 | (2) An authorisation given by virtue of this section may authorise the exercise of a function—
-- src:1088 | (a) wholly or to a limited extent;
-- src:1089 | (b) generally or in particular cases or areas;
-- src:1090 | (c) unconditionally or subject to conditions.
@ref s 57 WRA2007 11K(2) (src:1087-1090)
