GIVEN `the purpose` IS A `s 57 WRA2007 11K purpose`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 57 WRA2007 11K(4) the act of the authorised person is treated as the act of the Secretary of State for that purpose` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the purpose`
    WHEN `s 57 WRA2007 11K(4) for all purposes other than those in subsection (5)` THEN TRUE
